From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mikai project <owner>
Date: ...
Subject: [PATCH] aji: add GET_META support for mikai_native status snapshot

This patch adds support for MP_FILTER_COMMAND_GET_META on the animejanai
filter so that the Qt side can read a structured status snapshot via
vf-metadata/mikai_native without parsing human logs.

The snapshot includes protocol, revision, state (including Probe for
passthrough), requested/effective, geometry, device info (UUID/LUID),
counters, etc.

This is required for M19/M09 protocol.

diff --git a/src/aji.cpp b/src/aji.cpp
index ...
--- a/src/aji.cpp
+++ b/src/aji.cpp
@@ -... 
+/* Mikai addition: support GET_META for status */
+static int get_meta(struct mp_filter *f, void *res)
+{
+    /* return a mp_tags* with the mikai_native snapshot */
+    ...
+}
+
 /* existing command handling */
 static bool animejanai_command(...)
 {
     ...
+    if (cmd == MP_FILTER_COMMAND_GET_META) {
+        return get_meta(f, res);
+    }
     ...
 }
